# Build context excludes for the FRONTEND image (context = repo root).
# Without this, `COPY apps ./apps` drags host node_modules (macOS-native
# binaries) into a linux/amd64 image and the build silently uses the wrong
# esbuild/rollup platform binary.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.agent
.claude
.gemini

.env
.env.*

backend
docs
design-system
graphify-out

*.md
.DS_Store
